{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜AI助拆解海豚語言 Google DeepMind參與研究           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">「野生海豚計畫」創辦人兼研究主任Denise Herzing在WIRED世界博覽會上表示，等待40年後，人工智能終於協助她研究海豚的溝通方式。團隊已收集大量海豚影片及錄音，並與佐治亞理工學院及Google DeepMind的科學家合作，嘗試建立海豚交流的框架。研究人員以可在水下操作的手提電腦播放海豚聲音，配合圍巾、馬尾藻等物件進行雙向交流測試。她承認，分辨海豚真正理解還是單純模仿是一大難題，但團隊已發現一些規律；目前尚未完全解讀海豚語言，距離雙向對話仍有一大段距離。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T06:14:57.007571+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T02:30:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T06:57:26.969424+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T06:08:32.419984+00:00","content_hash":"8836ee711e79e0999eec77fcaa28f84e757283251ea3cee1e4f103142088dfcb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}